    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d330">

                <pb facs="0391" n="377" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg377"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/2706: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-26T14:00:00-03:00">January 26, 1944—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 3:16 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>219. My telegram number 1849, August 12, [1943,] 7 p.m.<anchor n="27"
                        xml:id="d330-f1"/> Foreign Minister<anchor n="28" xml:id="d330-f2"/> has
                    informed me that included in a number of arrests police have rearrested the six
                    German spies listed in telegram under reference.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
