                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 12, <ref target="#pg232">p. 232</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d330-f2" n="28" xml:id="d330-f2-content">
                <p>Gen. Alberto Gilbert.</p>
            </note>
